#. type: Plain text
#: sensible-editor.man
msgid ""
"If all of these fail, B<sensible-editor> errors out.  This system is "
"designed to make it easy for individual users to set a personal and/or "
"temporary default, overriding the system-wide defaults."
msgstr ""

